flowchart TD
    A[Feature Complete] --> B[Regression]
    B --> C[Financial Concurrency Tests]
    C --> D[Security Review]
    D --> E[Report Reconciliation]
    E --> F[Staging Smoke]
    F --> G[Backup / Restore Test]
    G --> H[UAT]
    H --> I{Blocking Defects?}
